&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of C or C++ programming experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of Java and JVM internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of OOP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multithreaded programming experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with system or UI application development on Unix, Windows, or macOS (using Cocoa, GNOME, Win32 API, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of modern hardware-accelerated APIs, such as Metal, Vulkan, OpenGL, or D3D.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to optimize and refactor code, both yours and that of others.&lt;/li&gt;
